<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Tools | Mehdi LATIF</title><link>https://mlatif.fr/en/tag/Tools/</link><atom:link href="https://mlatif.fr/en/tag/Tools/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><description>Tools</description><generator>Source Themes Academic (https://sourcethemes.com/academic/)</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 30 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><image><url>https://mlatif.fr/img/avatar.jpg</url><title>Tools</title><link>https://mlatif.fr/en/tag/Tools/</link></image><item><title>NEMA Script</title><link>https://mlatif.fr/en/software/nema/</link><pubDate>Tue, 30 Dec 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mlatif.fr/en/software/nema/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;strong>NEMA Script&lt;/strong> gathers scripts for generating and preparing NEMA-type digital phantoms for tomographic reconstruction experiments.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Two phantoms are currently available:&lt;/p>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>the NEMA NU 4 phantom section 3 for spatial resolution analysis&lt;/li>
&lt;li>the NEMA NU 4 phantom for quality image assessment (section 6).&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>The outputs are compatible with the CASToR and POLLUX reconstruction workflows.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>NIST PARSER</title><link>https://mlatif.fr/en/software/nistparser/</link><pubDate>Thu, 01 Sep 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mlatif.fr/en/software/nistparser/</guid><description/></item><item><title>TIFTEX</title><link>https://mlatif.fr/en/software/tiftex/</link><pubDate>Fri, 01 Jan 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mlatif.fr/en/software/tiftex/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>